# Whether a permanent is a Dragon is judged as it enters (CR 603.6a): Phantasmal Image enters as a copy of Bot1's Nova Hellkite, a
# Dragon, so it triggers Sarkhan too (it is a Dragon you control), as the Hellkite itself did. Two triggers, two +1/+1 counters:
# Sarkhan is a 4/4 Dragon with flying until end of turn, a 2/2 again with the counters on turn 4 (a 4/4). The Hellkite's enters
# trigger, shared by the copy, has no creature an opponent controls to hit and is left off the stack.

